  m_text: 'The great tyrant of Harlington has been defeated.


    He was just one
    of many lords in these areas


    A dangerous terror looms over the rest of
    Brittania


    Will you free the rest of London?


    Or will you back off
    and hide like a coward..?


    Thanks for playing.


    - Sincerely the F.O.A.R
    team



'
